      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div class="wi_fic_desc" property="description"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jacob had heard about the plague of men playing women's sports. During Spring 2021, he thought, "I kinda need to get out of here, and I'm excellent at soccer." He had to do some things that felt counter to his faith. But under his new guise as Sofia, he'll have a place to land and a scholarship at an expensive school.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Can he convince the other girls he's one of them for four years? Can he hack the secular world? And, when contact with that world blows his horizons open, can he live with the consequences?&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
